        <img decoding="async" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Map showing Skilled Electrical, Aircon and Solar at 8 Moncur Place, Addington, Christchurch" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block;">
        <div style="position:absolute; left:50%; bottom:14px; transform:translateX(-50%); background:#17140f; color:#f2e6c4; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.05em; text-transform:uppercase; padding:6px 14px; border-radius:100px; white-space:nowrap;">Get Directions</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section style="padding:80px 0; background:#faf7f0;">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px;">
      <div class="eyebrow" style="text-align:center;">FAQ</div>
      <h2 class="section-h2" style="text-align:center; margin-top:10px;">Common Questions</h2>
      <div class="rule center"></div>
      <div style="margin-top:40px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px;">
        <div class="skel-faq-item skel-faq-item--open" style="background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e7e1d2; border-radius:6px; overflow:hidden;">
          <button type="button" class="skel-faq-q" style="width:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; padding:20px 24px; cursor:pointer; background:none; border:none; text-align:left; font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;">
            <span style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; color:#17140f;">What areas does Skilled Electrical service?</span>
            <svg class="skel-faq-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#d4a017" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="min-width:18px; transition: transform 0.15s ease;"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="skel-faq-a" style="padding:0 24px 22px; font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.7; color:#4a4335;">We're locally owned and operated from Addington, Christchurch, and service homes and businesses across Christchurch and the wider Canterbury region.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="skel-faq-item" style="background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e7e1d2; border-radius:6px; overflow:hidden;">
          <button type="button" class="skel-faq-q" style="width:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; padding:20px 24px; cursor:pointer; background:none; border:none; text-align:left; font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;">
            <span style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; color:#17140f;">What&rsquo;s the difference between a wall-mounted and a ducted heat pump?</span>
            <svg class="skel-faq-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#d4a017" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="min-width:18px; transition: transform 0.15s ease;"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="skel-faq-a" style="padding:0 24px 22px; font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.7; color:#4a4335;">Wall-mounted heat pumps are a cost-effective option for heating a single room or open-plan space, with quick installation and lower upfront investment. Ducted systems heat and cool the whole home from a hidden ceiling unit, giving even temperatures room-to-room, zone control and a clean, vent-only finish &mdash; better suited to new builds, renovations, or a premium whole-home result.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="skel-faq-item" style="background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e7e1d2; border-radius:6px; overflow:hidden;">
          <button type="button" class="skel-faq-q" style="width:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; padding:20px 24px; cursor:pointer; background:none; border:none; text-align:left; font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;">
            <span style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; color:#17140f;">How much can I save with a hot water heat pump?</span>
            <svg class="skel-faq-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#d4a017" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="min-width:18px; transition: transform 0.15s ease;"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="skel-faq-a" style="padding:0 24px 22px; font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.7; color:#4a4335;">Hot water heat pumps can cut hot water energy costs by up to 70% compared with a standard electric cylinder, using heat pump technology to draw more heat from the electricity they use. Typical payback is 4&ndash;7 years, with a system lifespan of 12&ndash;18 years.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="skel-faq-item" style="background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e7e1d2; border-radius:6px; overflow:hidden;">
          <button type="button" class="skel-faq-q" style="width:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; padding:20px 24px; cursor:pointer; background:none; border:none; text-align:left; font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;">
            <span style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; color:#17140f;">Do you work on rental, commercial and aged care properties?</span>
            <svg class="skel-faq-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#d4a017" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="min-width:18px; transition: transform 0.15s ease;"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="skel-faq-a" style="padding:0 24px 22px; font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.7; color:#4a4335;">Yes. We maintain and upgrade electrical systems for residential rentals, commercial premises, multi-unit developments, and aged care and specialist facilities &mdash; working around occupants, staff and day-to-day operations with minimal disruption.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="skel-faq-item" style="background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e7e1d2; border-radius:6px; overflow:hidden;">
          <button type="button" class="skel-faq-q" style="width:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; padding:20px 24px; cursor:pointer; background:none; border:none; text-align:left; font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;">
            <span style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; color:#17140f;">How much does an electrical call-out cost in Christchurch?</span>
            <svg class="skel-faq-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#d4a017" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="min-width:18px; transition: transform 0.15s ease;"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="skel-faq-a" style="padding:0 24px 22px; font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.7; color:#4a4335;">As a guide, an electrical service call-out to investigate a fault or breakdown is typically $145 (excluding GST). From there, our electrical hourly rate is typically $95/hr, with our aircon hourly rate slightly higher at $98/hr. Prices exclude GST and may vary following a site visit and/or fitting upgrades &mdash; call our team on 03 382 1668 for more information.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="skel-faq-item" style="background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e7e1d2; border-radius:6px; overflow:hidden;">
          <button type="button" class="skel-faq-q" style="width:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; padding:20px 24px; cursor:pointer; background:none; border:none; text-align:left; font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;">
            <span style="font-size:16px; font-weight:700; color:#17140f;">Are you an authorised installer for major heat pump and solar brands?</span>
            <svg class="skel-faq-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#d4a017" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="min-width:18px; transition: transform 0.15s ease;"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="skel-faq-a" style="padding:0 24px 22px; font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.7; color:#4a4335;">Yes &mdash; our team is a proud authorised installer for Panasonic, Daikin and Mitsubishi Electric.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FINAL CTA -->
  <section style="padding:72px 0; background:#d4a017;">
    <div class="wrap" style="display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:32px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <div>
        <h2 style="color:#17140f; font-size:38px;">Need Reliable Electrical, Aircon or Solar Work?</h2>
        <p style="color:#4a4335; font-size:15px; margin-top:4px;"><a href="https://share.google/PtV5iNOhTUTDDkwvy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#17140f; text-decoration:underline;">8 Moncur Place, Addington, Christchurch</a> &middot; <a href="mailto:office@skilledelectrical.co.nz" style="color:#17140f; text-decoration:underline;">office@skilledelectrical.co.nz</a></p>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <a href="https://skilledelectrical.co.nz/contact-us/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-outline" style="color:#17140f; border-color:#17140f;">Get a Quote</a>
        <a href="tel:+6433821668" class="btn-gold" style="background:#17140f; color:#ffffff;">Call 03 382 1668</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

<script>
(function () {
  var items = document.querySelectorAll('.skel-home .skel-faq-item');
  items.forEach(function (item) {
    var btn = item.querySelector('.skel-faq-q');
    if (!btn) return;
    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
      var isOpen = item.classList.contains('skel-faq-item--open');
      items.forEach(function (other) {
        other.classList.remove('skel-faq-item--open');
      });
      if (!isOpen) {
        item.classList.add('skel-faq-item--open');
      }
    });
  });
})();
</script>

